	"description":	{
		"":	"Rectangular Pattern, with the value window as its dialog: one direction by default (Two opens a second), cycled by the Cycle Direction key. A feature cut into one face goes along that face's own axes (Absolute for the component's X, Y, Z), directions that would miss the body are dropped; bodies go along X, Y, Z; inside a sketch it makes a sketch pattern constraint. Quantity and distance as expressions, made in the patterned things' component."
	},
	"version":	"",
	"runOnStartup":	true,
	"supportedOS":	"mac",
	"editEnabled":	true
}
